      "content": "It sounds like you are in a place of profound despair, and those feelings of hopelessness can feel overwhelming. Please know that these intense feelings are treatable, and there are people who want to support you right now. If you are feeling like you want to end your life, please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline like 988 in the US or your local emergency services. You do not have to carry this burden alone.",
      "source": "target",
