      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those thoughts of wanting to control the ending are understandable when facing something so scary, but please know that there are options besides what you are envisioning. Your capacity to think and drive right now shows incredible strength, and there are ways to manage this decline without losing all control. Reaching out to a medical professional can help you understand what is happening and explore treatments that might help maintain your current quality of life. Please let someone help you navigate these difficult feelings.",
